text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "As Phyrexian Revoker enters the battlefield, choose a nonland card name.\nActivated abilities of sources with the chosen name can't be activated.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nDraw three cards.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may have Cryptoplasm become a copy of another target creature, except it has this ability.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may look at the top card of your library. You may cast it without paying its mana cost if it's an instant or sorcery spell.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a charge counter on target artifact.', 'Attacking creatures get +1/+0 and gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Battle cry (Whenever this creature attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)', 'Battle cry (Whenever this creature attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)\nKuldotha Ringleader attacks each combat if able.', "Battle cry (Whenever this creature attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)\nSignal Pest can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.", 'Battle cry (Whenever this creature attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)\nWhenever Hero of Bladehold attacks, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens that are tapped and attacking.', "Burn the Impure deals 3 damage to target creature. If that creature has infect, Burn the Impure deals 3 damage to that creature's controller.", "Choose one —\n• Counter target artifact spell.\n• Return target artifact to its owner's hand.", 'Choose one —\n• Slagstorm deals 3 damage to each creature.\n• Slagstorm deals 3 damage to each player.', "Concussive Bolt deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker.\nMetalcraft — If you control three or more artifacts, creatures controlled by that player or by that planeswalker's controller can't block this turn.", 'Counter target spell, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', "Create X 2/2 white Cat creature tokens. Shuffle White Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", 'Create two 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature tokens.', 'Creatures your opponents control get -2/-0 until end of turn.', "Defender\nMetalcraft — As long as you control three or more artifacts, Spire Serpent gets +2/+2 and can attack as though it didn't have defender.", 'Destroy all artifacts.', 'Destroy all creatures, then create an X/X colorless Phyrexian Horror artifact creature token, where X is the number of creatures destroyed this way.', 'Destroy target artifact. You gain life equal to its mana value.', 'Destroy target creature with flying. Its controller gets a poison counter.', 'Destroy target creature, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Destroy target nonartifact creature.', 'Destroy target noncreature artifact.', 'Double strike, protection from black and from green', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has infect. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', 'Enchant creature\nYou control enchanted creature.\nEnchanted creature has infect. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has first strike.\nEquip {1}', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and is an artifact in addition to its other types.\nEquip {2}', "Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has protection from black and from green.\nWhenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card and you untap all lands you control.\nEquip {2}', 'Exile two target artifacts.', 'First strike, deathtouch\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls dies, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'First strike, protection from red and from white\nInfect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', 'Flash\nYou may cast artifact spells as though they had flash.', 'Flying', "Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control no Thopters other than Thopter Assembly, return Thopter Assembly to its owner's hand and create five 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.", 'Flying\nInfect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', 'Flying\nInfect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nSacrifice a creature: Flesh-Eater Imp gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhen Serum Raker dies, each player discards a card.', "Flying\nWhenever Victory's Herald attacks, attacking creatures gain flying and lifelink until end of turn.", 'Flying\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls dies, you may gain 3 life.\nWhenever an opponent discards a card, you may gain 3 life.', 'Flying\nWhenever an opponent draws a card, you may draw two cards.', 'Flying\nWhenever you cast an artifact spell, you may untap target creature.', 'Flying, haste\n{1}{R}: Hellkite Igniter gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of artifacts you control.', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Gain control of target artifact until end of turn. Untap that artifact. It gains haste until end of turn.', "Haste\nBattle cry (Whenever this creature attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)\nWhenever Hero of Oxid Ridge attacks, creatures with power 1 or less can't block this turn.", 'Imprint — When Knowledge Pool enters the battlefield, each player exiles the top three cards of their library.\nWhenever a player casts a spell from their hand, that player exiles it. If the player does, they may cast a spell from among other cards exiled with Knowledge Pool without paying its mana cost.', 'Imprint — {T}: Exile target artifact card from a graveyard.\nMyr Welder has all activated abilities of all cards exiled with it.', 'Indestructible\nEquipped creature has indestructible.\nEquip {2}', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you get a poison counter.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nIf damage would be dealt to Phyrexian Hydra, prevent that damage. Put a -1/-1 counter on Phyrexian Hydra for each 1 damage prevented this way.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nLifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nPhyrexian Juggernaut attacks each combat if able.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nWhen Core Prowler dies, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nWhen Viridian Corrupter enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nWhenever Septic Rats attacks, if defending player is poisoned, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Rot Wolf this turn dies, you may draw a card.', 'Infect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\nEquipped creature gets +0/+1 and has "Sacrifice this creature: This creature deals 1 damage to any target."\nEquip {2}', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\nEquipped creature gets +1/+1.\nEquip {2}', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\nEquipped creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.\nEquip {6}', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\nEquipped creature gets +2/+4 and has reach.\nEquip {4}', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Phyrexian Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\nEquipped creature gets +X/+X, where X is the number of creature cards in all graveyards.\nEquip {2}', 'Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal any number of creature cards from among them and put the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Look at the top seven cards of your library. You may put one of those cards onto the battlefield if it has the same name as a permanent. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Melira's Keepers can't have counters put on it.", 'Metalcraft — Ardent Recruit gets +2/+2 as long as you control three or more artifacts.', 'Metalcraft — Razorfield Rhino gets +2/+2 as long as you control three or more artifacts.', 'Metalcraft — Spiraling Duelist has double strike as long as you control three or more artifacts.', "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Psychosis Crawler's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.\nWhenever you draw a card, each opponent loses 1 life.", "Put X -1/-1 counters on each creature. Shuffle Black Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", 'Put a -1/-1 counter on each attacking creature.', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature. When that creature dies this turn, its controller gets a poison counter.', 'Put any number of target artifact cards from your graveyard on top of your library.\nDraw a card.', "Put target artifact, creature, or enchantment on top of its owner's library.", "Put target creature card from an opponent's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step. If that creature would leave the battlefield, exile it instead of putting it anywhere else.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nInfect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', "Red Sun's Zenith deals X damage to any target. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it instead. Shuffle Red Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", "Return all cards from your graveyard to your hand. Exile Praetor's Counsel. You have no maximum hand size for the rest of the game.", 'Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return up to two target nonland permanents to their owners' hands.", "Sacrifice Gore Vassal: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature. Then if that creature's toughness is 1 or greater, regenerate it.", 'Sacrifice an artifact: Gnathosaur gains trample until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice an artifact: Regenerate Rusted Slasher.', 'Search your library for a card, exile it, then shuffle. Any opponent may have you put that card into your hand. If no player does, you draw three cards.', "Search your library for a green creature card with mana value X or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. Shuffle Green Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", 'Shriekhorn enters the battlefield with three charge counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Shriekhorn: Target player mills two cards.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nWhenever Neurok Commando deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.", 'Sphere of the Suns enters the battlefield tapped and with three charge counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Sphere of the Suns: Add one mana of any color.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\nMetalcraft — That creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn instead if you control three or more artifacts.', 'Target player discards a card, then mills a card.', "Target player draws X cards. Shuffle Blue Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", "This spell can't be countered.\nHexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Thrun, the Last Troll.", "Training Drone can't attack or block unless it's equipped.", 'Trample', "Trample, infect, indestructible\nIf Blightsteel Colossus would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, reveal Blightsteel Colossus and shuffle it into its owner's library instead.", 'Vigilance\nInfect (This creature deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)', "Vigilance\nKemba's Legion can block an additional creature each combat for each Equipment attached to Kemba's Legion.", 'When Blisterstick Shaman enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Caustic Hound dies, each player loses 4 life.', 'When Ichor Wellspring enters the battlefield or is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Kuldotha Flamefiend enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice an artifact. If you do, Kuldotha Flamefiend deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', "When Leonin Relic-Warder enters the battlefield, you may exile target artifact or enchantment.\nWhen Leonin Relic-Warder leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Massacre Wurm enters the battlefield, creatures your opponents control get -2/-2 until end of turn.\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls dies, that player loses 2 life.', 'When Myr Sire dies, create a 1/1 colorless Phyrexian Myr artifact creature token.', 'When Oculus dies, you may draw a card.', 'When Peace Strider enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'When Phyrexian Rager enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Pierce Strider enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 3 life.', 'When Piston Sledge enters the battlefield, attach it to target creature you control.\nEquipped creature gets +3/+1.\nEquip—Sacrifice an artifact.', "When Spine of Ish Sah enters the battlefield, destroy target permanent.\nWhen Spine of Ish Sah is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Spine of Ish Sah to its owner's hand.", 'When Treasure Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 6 or greater, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Viridian Emissary dies, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to you, that creature's controller gains control of Contested War Zone.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Attacking creatures get +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Whenever a source deals damage to Nested Ghoul, create a 2/2 black Phyrexian Zombie creature token.', 'Whenever an artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may gain 5 life.', "Whenever another artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, Magnetic Mine deals 2 damage to that artifact's controller.", "Whenever another nontoken artifact enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that artifact.", '[+1]: Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\n[−1]: Target artifact becomes an artifact creature with base power and toughness 5/5.\n[−4]: Target player loses X life and you gain X life, where X is twice the number of artifacts you control.', '{2}{B}: Dross Ripper gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{2}{G}: Regenerate Tangle Hulk.', '{2}{U}, {T}: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature. You may tap or untap that creature.', '{3}, {T}: Put a charge counter on Titan Forge.\n{T}, Remove three charge counters from Titan Forge: Create a 9/9 colorless Golem artifact creature token.', '{4}, {T}: Target opponent loses 2 life, gets a poison counter, then mills six cards.', "{R}: Target creature can't block Spin Engine this turn.", '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}: Inkmoth Nexus becomes a 1/1 Phyrexian Blinkmoth artifact creature with flying and infect until end of turn. It's still a land. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)", '{T}: Attach target Equipment you control to target creature you control.', '{T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature token.\n{T}, Tap five untapped Myr you control: Search your library for a Myr creature card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{U}: Gust-Skimmer gains flying until end of turn.', '{W}: Bladed Sentinel gains vigilance until end of turn.']
